{"id":"04-context","number":4,"slug":"context-engineering","title":"Context is everything","short":"Context is everything","module":"Working with one agent","summary":"Almost every best practice for coding agents comes from one constraint: the context window fills up fast, and quality drops as it fills. Learn the smart zone and the dumb zone, why fresh sessions beat long ones, and the four moves of context engineering.","voice":"Eric","scenes":[{"template":"title","chapter":"Intro","narration":"If you remember one lesson from this course, make it this one. Almost every best practice for working with coding agents comes from a single constraint.","params":{"kicker":"Lesson 4","module":"Module 2 · Working with one agent","title":"Context is *everything*","subtitle":"The smart zone, the dumb zone, and how to stay smart.","bubble":"My memory is… limited.","mood":"think"},"start":0.5,"dur":10.108,"words":[{"text":"If","s":0.8,"e":0.96},{"text":"you","s":1,"e":1.04},{"text":"remember","s":1.12,"e":1.52},{"text":"one","s":1.68,"e":1.84},{"text":"lesson","s":1.92,"e":2.24},{"text":"from","s":2.32,"e":2.4},{"text":"this","s":2.48,"e":2.56},{"text":"course,","s":2.64,"e":3.36},{"text":"make","s":3.44,"e":3.6},{"text":"it","s":3.68,"e":3.76},{"text":"this","s":3.88,"e":4},{"text":"one.","s":4.08,"e":4.52},{"text":"Almost","s":4.8,"e":5.28},{"text":"every","s":5.36,"e":5.6},{"text":"best","s":5.68,"e":5.84},{"text":"practice","s":5.92,"e":6.4},{"text":"for","s":6.48,"e":6.56},{"text":"working","s":6.64,"e":6.88},{"text":"with","s":6.96,"e":7.04},{"text":"coding","s":7.12,"e":7.36},{"text":"agents","s":7.44,"e":7.84},{"text":"comes","s":8,"e":8.16},{"text":"from","s":8.24,"e":8.32},{"text":"a","s":8.4,"e":8.48},{"text":"single","s":8.56,"e":8.8},{"text":"constraint.","s":8.88,"e":9.76}]},{"template":"quote","chapter":"The constraint","narration":"Anthropic's own guide to Claude Code says it plainly. Most best practices are based on one constraint: the context window fills up fas