"s":39.731,"e":39.891},{"text":"memory.","s":40.091,"e":40.531}]},{"template":"context","chapter":"Smart zone, dumb zone","narration":"Here's the catch. Quality doesn't hold steady until the window is full. Dex Horthy calls the early part the smart zone. Past it comes the dumb zone, where the agent forgets instructions and contradicts itself. His rule of thumb for beginners: try to stay under about forty percent, and start wrapping up around sixty.","params":{"title":"One session's context window","cap":"200K tokens","blocks":[{"label":"system + tools","kind":"sys","w":0.1,"at":"early"},{"label":"memory","kind":"mem","w":0.04},{"label":"your task","kind":"you","w":0.04},{"label":"files read","kind":"file","w":0.18,"at":"smart zone"},{"label":"test output","kind":"out","w":0.14,"at":"dumb zone"},{"label":"retries","kind":"junk","w":0.16,"at":"contradicts"}],"zones":[{"from":0,"to":0.4,"label":"smart zone","tone":"good"},{"from":0.4,"to":0.6,"label":"wrap up","tone":"warn"},{"from":0.6,"to":1,"label":"dumb zone","tone":"bad"}],"zones_at":"smart zone","rot":{"at":"forgets","from":0.45}},"start":41.139,"dur":20.986,"words":[{"text":"Here's","s":41.439,"e":41.719},{"text":"the","s":41.759,"e":41.839},{"text":"catch.","s":41.919,"e":42.599},{"text":"Quality","s":42.879,"e":43.359},{"text":"doesn't","s":43.519,"e":43.759},{"text":"hold","s":43.839,"e":44.079},{"text":"steady","s":44.159,"e":44.559},{"text":"until","s":44.679,"e":44.799},{"text":"the","s":44.879,"e":44.919},{"text":"window","s":44.959,"e":45.199},{"text":"is","s":45.279,"e":45.359},{"text":"full.","s":45.519,"e":45.839},{"text":"Dex","s":46.319,"e":46.559},{"text":"Horthy","s":46.599,"e":46.959},{"text":"calls","s":47.039,"e":47.279},{"text":"the","s":47.319,"e":47.359},{"text":"early","s":47.519,"e":47.759},{"text":"part","s":47.839,"e":48.159},{"text":"the","s":48.239,"e":48.319},{"text":"smart","s":48.479,"e":48.799},{"text":"zone.","s":48.879,"e":49.199},{"text":"Past","s":49.679,"e":49.999},{"text":"it