:"Summarize this session for a fresh agent: goal, decisions, what failed and why, key files, next step. Under 200 words.","at":"summarize"},{"from":"agent","text":"**Goal:** fix flaky auth test. **Decided:** keep real token check. **Failed:** mocking the module (hides the bug). **Files:** auth.ts, session.ts. **Next:** fix the clock skew in session.ts.","tone":"good","at":"decided"},{"from":"you","text":"/clear  → paste the summary","label":"fresh start","at":"clear"}]},"start":132.694,"dur":19.784,"words":[{"text":"Here's","s":132.994,"e":133.274},{"text":"how","s":133.314,"e":133.394},{"text":"to","s":133.434,"e":133.474},{"text":"restart","s":133.554,"e":134.034},{"text":"without","s":134.114,"e":134.514},{"text":"losing","s":134.594,"e":134.834},{"text":"progress.","s":134.914,"e":135.794},{"text":"Ask","s":136.114,"e":136.354},{"text":"the","s":136.394,"e":136.434},{"text":"agent","s":136.594,"e":136.834},{"text":"to","s":136.874,"e":136.914},{"text":"summarize","s":137.074,"e":137.474},{"text":"the","s":137.554,"e":137.634},{"text":"session","s":137.714,"e":138.034},{"text":"for","s":138.114,"e":138.194},{"text":"a","s":138.274,"e":138.354},{"text":"fresh","s":138.434,"e":138.674},{"text":"agent:","s":138.754,"e":139.474},{"text":"the","s":139.554,"e":139.594},{"text":"goal,","s":139.634,"e":140.274},{"text":"what","s":140.354,"e":140.434},{"text":"was","s":140.514,"e":140.594},{"text":"decided,","s":140.714,"e":141.474},{"text":"what","s":141.554,"e":141.634},{"text":"failed,","s":141.794,"e":142.434},{"text":"which","s":142.514,"e":142.594},{"text":"files","s":142.674,"e":142.994},{"text":"matter.","s":143.074,"e":143.474},{"text":"Review","s":143.954,"e":144.274},{"text":"it,","s":144.354,"e":144.754},{"text":"clear,","s":144.954,"e":145.394},{"text":"and","s":145.434,"e":145.474},{"text":"paste","s":145.554,"e":145.794},{"text":"it","s":145.874,"e":145.914},{"text":"in.","s":145.954,"e":146.194},{"text":"As","s":146.754,"e":146.834},{"text":"Brendan","s":1